  "document": "Mitridate, re di Ponto\nMitridate, re di Ponto (\"Mithridates, King of Pontus\"), K. 87 (74a), is an early opera seria in three acts by Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart. The libretto is by after Giuseppe Parini's Italian translation of Jean Racine's play \"Mithridate\"."
